<title>USA: Forrest City Financial FY96 EPS rises to $1.25.</title>
<headline>Forrest City Financial FY96 EPS rises to $1.25.</headline>
<dateline>FORREST CITY, Ark. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.25		    $0.67</p>
<p> Net		 254			147</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Forrest City Financial Corp and the stock trades on the Nasdaq pink sheets under the symbol &quot;FOCF.&quot;</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it repurchased 21,574 shares of stock during fiscal year 1996. It said the increase in net income was due to an increase in loans and interest rates on loans.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
